{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-10_beg","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-09","title":"哭聲漸息","storyCode":"16-10","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"8991a410f5787144ca8cebb24dcd02a6914c6ffa95de431fac3dfb70396886ca","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"火災撲滅後，雷爾金想代替兇手接受懲罰，卻被倖存的村民們拒絕。最終，真正的兇手被審判並處決，而礦工隊伍因此分裂。選擇留下的別喬克在悲傷中開始自我詰問。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"雪、雪、雪。\n雪落在頭上。\n變成滾燙的水，變成綿延的呼喊，變成死者的重量。\n沒有一雙手來得及將它拂去。它潮濕、滯重、不斷下沉……\n直到壓垮那些身處其中的、仍活著的人。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g15_ursusvillage_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕哼旋律）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，您感覺，怎麼樣……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕哼旋律）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……滴答、滴答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滴答、滴答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕哼旋律）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時鐘，滴答，作響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時鐘，不等，任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但我們，不該唱歌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧……我們走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊沒有倖存者了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我好像站不起來了。利特，你還在嗎？可能要有人來扶我一下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利特？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看那邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火滅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，火早就熄滅了，甚至已經有倖存的村民發現我們了。我們得做些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，你打算讓霍里就這樣一直跪在這裡嗎？就算他瘋了做出這種事，處置他也沒必要用這種折磨人的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火熄滅後四周還在持續降溫，再這樣下去他會死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，他會死。但……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是現在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷爾金望向村莊的入口。\n曾經那裡是一排整齊的柵欄，只為阻擋尋找食物的牙獸而設，攔不住任何有心進入的過路人，無論他們懷有善意，還是包藏禍心。\n零落的人影開始出現在柵欄的殘骸後方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他們顫顫巍巍地打量，而後畏縮地走開。\n雷爾金的語氣幾乎像是在自言自語——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我做錯了，尼克托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"霍里沒發瘋。他在火場裡喊出的那些話，不是對別喬克的奶奶，也不是對他死去的兒子，而是對我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“……至此，我犯下殺戮的罪過，不為食物，不為潔淨的水，不為溫暖的房屋。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我只為與我同行的眾人，願他們的靈魂能得到救贖。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我什麼也沒聽到。就算他說了，也不過是別喬克和她奶奶常說的那種禱告詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們信聖愚、信皇帝那套東西也不是一天兩天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“聖愚”？“皇帝”？沒有那些虛無縹緲的東西，有的只是我逼他殺死了自己的孩子，他卻仍想拯救我的靈魂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這個靈魂究竟是什麼東西？誰又能證明它的存在？而且，它難道比在世的性命更寶貴？可笑……太可笑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不該逼他的，我不該，但現在最壞的結果已經造成了。如果之前他那樣做是為了達成我的希望，那如今他放的這把火，目的理應相同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，聽我說，沒有這樣的道理——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，這把火也是我放的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須償還。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，別做傻事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我儘量長話短說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你們……你們還想說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我們給你們糧食和乾淨的水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你們的回報？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"絕對不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"那你現在擋在這裡，是想把我們趕走，還是想繼續動手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望你們見證兇手得到應有的下場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"呵……呵呵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"兇手？下場？難道你會把放火的人、殺人的人、搶劫的人全都抓出來殺死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你做不到，否則你也不會拿著武器來跟我說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我就當你沒說過吧。如果你不想繼續對我們趕盡殺絕，那就離開這裡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"別再出現了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷爾金放下手中的礦鎬，又卸下身上的所有武器，然後舉起雙手，向眼前的人示意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滾開，尼克托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"那你們，也還有源石技藝……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在這裡，我會把兇手直接交出來，任你們處置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經放下武器，我也不會使用源石技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以做你想做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂了。你是想用你自己，你想用一個人包庇許多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我不太會算數……卻也知道這不是一個划算的買賣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我絕不反抗，我就在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我不要你，我們不要你！起火時你根本不在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我要那個放了第一把火的人，我要那個趁機搶掠的人，我要那個毀了我家園的人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我要那個，殺死我妻子的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使他的暴力源自於我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的自大才讓隊伍處於這樣的困境之中，是我的逼迫才讓他選擇殘暴的處理方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該殺了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽我說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"除了那個人，我們誰也不要。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g15_ursusvillage_ruins"},{"type":"narration","text":"廢墟中清理出了一片空地，一場處決將在那裡進行。\n人們不由自主地圍攏過去，像圍攏一團寒夜裡的火，又畏懼被其溫度灼傷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是不懂，霍里到底為什麼要放火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對幫助了我們的村莊，做出這樣的事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他瘋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自從他兒子死了之後，他就不太對勁了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，會不會——會不會其實不是他放的火？雷爾金只是想給那些人一個交代，霍里又剛好病得很重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認識的霍里不會做這樣的事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，但我相信雷爾金。你不知道嗎？他甚至已經為霍里爭取過了，他想用他自己去換霍里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好那些村民堅持要真正的兇手，而不是一個代替他受罰的好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……反正，我不想看了，雖然還沒有開始……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我要走了，我要休息一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別動，雷爾金要開始講話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人差不多都到齊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）……分擔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）痛苦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在殺死這個人之前，我還有幾句話想說，不是為兇手辯解，也不是為了代替他向受害者求得原諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"倖存的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他該死，沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他踐踏了善意和信任，將所有人置於危險的境地。他違背了我們儘力活下去的初衷，傷害了無辜的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，在我們選擇的道路上，死亡在所難免，但不應該以這樣的方式，或出於類似的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，請你們仔細看著。記住他的教訓，也記住即將奪走他性命的人，正是最沒有這個資格的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我選擇殺死他，既出於受害者的要求，也出於我自身的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這也將是我最後一次以領袖的身分做出判斷。沒有人應該背負殺死同伴的罪名，因此……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"懺悔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罪過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雪在霍里肩膀上累積了厚厚一層。他像是什麼也沒聽見一樣再次跪下去，虔誠地合攏雙掌，放在胸前。\n他仰頭，向處決者露出脖頸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒錯，既然我早已需要懺悔自己的罪過，那麼，就由我來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）很快再見，霍里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g15_ursusvillage_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死……我還以為至少能把這面鏡子拼好呢，結果摔得更碎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真不吉利。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，我們連霍里的遺體都不能帶走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們留下一具屍體根本沒用啊，難道要讓霍里暴屍荒野……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"問題在於我們沒有任何談判的資格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，如果你們繼續跟隨我，很有可能會得到相同的下場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲倦的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不跟著你又要跟著誰？現在不是開玩笑的時候吧，雷爾金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有開玩笑，這是一個決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個我剛才就說過的決定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"當雷爾金轉過身來，滿面髒汙和倦容的人群立刻像發現信標一樣再度聚集到他的周圍，只因為他在這裡。\n他們望向這個領頭者，茫然地等待下一步指示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，我們還繼續往南嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有力氣了。我只想要一個能遮擋風雪的屋簷，但這裡已經連這個都沒有了，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續走是死……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恍惚的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留下來也是死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，我沒找到他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保爾和波金娜……我沒找到他們，連屍體也沒有，對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些村民，他們不想讓我靠近，我放下礦鎬也不行。他們在害怕，不用眼睛看也知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想威脅他們。走吧，雷爾金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶我們走。"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷爾金的視線從每張臉上滑過，無論他們是否出聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，同伴們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來的路，不會由我來為你們決定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我之前說的，應該受到懲罰的並非霍里，而是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我，造成了他的殘暴和他的癲狂；是我一路以來做出的決定，將他逼入了這樣的困境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這件事發生之前，我甚至沒有意識到，原來不是所有人都做好了面對死亡的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事實證明，我欠缺獨斷專行的能力，因此我能做的最後同時也是最明智的決定，就是放棄當一名決策者……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把選擇權還給你們。"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉默。\n長久的沉默。\n沒有人回應，或者哪怕動彈一下也好，甚至連臉上的表情都沒有一絲細微的變化。\n所有聽到這個決定的人都沉默著，直到一個顫抖的聲音從人群的最尾端傳出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要……拋棄……我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是這樣的，別喬克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是，什麼？剛才，你的話……還能，怎麼……去理解？"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群自動為發問的人讓出一條通路。\n別喬克沒有上前。她站在原地，緊握雙拳，用力到指節發白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，“不決定”！在我們已經，走了……這麼遠的，時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是要，拋棄。你要拋棄，我們，所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有！我必須這樣做，以免對大家造成更壞的影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能接受再因為我專斷的決策而導致無謂的人員傷亡了。我們從礦區，從那個死人世界一路逃出來不是為了這樣的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“死人”……“世界”？但，那是，我的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礦區、礦井，是，我的……家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾經，是，很多人，的，家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……“家”？我以為你們都是主動想要逃離的，像我一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那都是，因為，信任。信任你，信任——雷爾金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來，你不……你不懂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為你們選擇離開，是因為早就想要離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你殺死，黑蟲子，站起來，說：“讓我們——離開！”所以……我們，離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你抓住，霍里，殺死他，又說：“帶你們，離開，是錯的！”還說這是，“選擇”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不——我不懂啊！我們，對你，到底是……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重要的友人、親人，這太複雜了，難以定義，但正因為你們對我很重要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且這裡，這裡是那些，村民的，家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許村莊，還能，重建。但是，我們呢？我們又要……去、去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，帶我們走了……這麼遠。如果現在，你不再這樣，做了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們，要怎麼，才能回——回去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，告訴我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們該怎麼，活下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別喬克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。你叫我，那種語氣。你又要，哄騙我。我已經，不是——我不是，小孩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不、不反駁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的話印證了我的猜想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前，我所做的一切，都只是將我的想法強加在你們身上，然後一意孤行。這使你們既不瞭解我的計劃，也不明白那些行動隱含的意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是信任我，而不是信任自己的選擇。那如果我不在了呢？你們又該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我很感謝你們的信任，但這樣不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，現在我要把問題說清楚，然後讓你們來做選擇。"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷爾金再次看向身前的每張面孔，確定自己已經引起了所有人的注意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前往烏卡邊境，尋找屬於感染者的農莊的確是我們的最終目標，但在過程中，我們也要讓這段旅途成為烏薩斯正視我們的契機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"問題在於，這樣做必定會讓我們自身陷入極端的危險，因為這是在試圖撼動烏薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾經有人這樣做過，而後他們銷聲匿跡了，只留下一個符號和一個名字，流傳在這片被髒雪和沼澤覆蓋的苔原上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果現在我說，跟隨我可能也會步上他們的後塵呢？對於任何想活下去的、理智的人來說，我都不會推薦他做出這個選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但我甚至沒有給霍里選擇的餘地。所以，他死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他讓我明白，我必須把選擇權交還給你們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群沒有回答，卻在一陣模糊的喧嘩後，逐漸分散開來。\n起初，差距並不顯著。一些人開始站到雷爾金的身邊或身後，另一些人則停在他的身前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，我們什麼時候走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到所有人都做出決定，我們馬上就啟程。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"更多的人走向雷爾金。差距逐漸顯現，那些腳步聲在別喬克聽來就像晚了一步的收工鐘聲。\n一，二，三……每數錯一個，也許就多一個人被礦井吞沒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰……不想，活著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼，非要，選？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我……"},{"type":"narration","text":"別喬克感覺那些人離自己越來越遠。\n她想抓住些什麼，無意識地往前踏出了一步，卻立刻就感覺到自己被拉住，她停了下來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——別喬克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐、姐姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也，要過去？剛才……你在哪裡？我不、不知道，該怎麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他們……他們都要，離開！離開我們，去送死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係、沒關係。我剛才去幫尼克托包紮傷口了，他被鏡子碎片割傷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這不重要。總之，我有聽到你們後半段的對話內容。你只是想活著，這沒有任何過錯，你不必強迫自己去走不認同的路，我也不會去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不——你不會？你不，離開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會，我和我的小隊會繼續幫助那些傷員。而且尼克托也不會離開，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……尼克托？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"即使分列兩邊，人群依舊熙攘，Raidian看不見尼克托的身影。她開始用源石技藝搜尋特定的電訊號頻段，很快便找到了方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在我們的隊伍後面，他不會離開——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……抱歉，塞拉菲娜女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尼克托——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，別喬克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能往回走。你知道我從聖駿堡來的，礦區從來都不是我的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，繼續往前也不一定只有死路一條。有我看著那傢伙，情況也許不會像他說的那麼糟糕，畢竟……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"機會都是由人創造的，對不對？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。不、不、不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼……為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼，一定要，這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼……總是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……分離？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g3_miningarea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕柔的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快點回去吧，別喬克，小心感冒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕柔的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等你睡著再醒來，媽媽爸爸就回家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"輕柔的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你當個聽話的乖小孩，不吵也不鬧，連奶奶都誇獎……那等你醒來，枕頭上就會有一塊巧克力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……罷工……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爭取權利……沒有……響應……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……死刑……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g4_miningarea_polluted"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“媽媽”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“爸爸”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“孩子”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……“奶奶”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“奶奶”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲哼唱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一句話！只要您的一句話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要一句話，我的靈魂——就會痊癒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“奶奶”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲哼唱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我……我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——我請求您……寬恕我……殺死……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急切的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您孩子的罪孽……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“奶奶”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我願意……”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“我願意默想，並分擔你的痛苦。”\n“為你，為他。願我們所有人都能真心懺悔所犯的罪過。”\n“願祂的恩澤行在地上，一如行在天上。”"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"cg_bonfire"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……奶奶？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"孩子，孩子♪\n現在閉上雙眼♪\n有誰正在窗外♪\n敲響門扉♪\n孩子，孩子♪\n止住你的呼吸♪\n有誰換上皮囊♪\n步入屋內♪\n他來了♪\n他來了♪"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i08_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲哼唱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……奶奶……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲哼唱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，有誰在……門外？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無人停留，無人等待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們……走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們哭著，親吻，您的手，說，“不想分開”，卻還是……分開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都有自己將行的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……所以，這是必然？但，為什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"受苦的靈魂啊，你知曉原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金……還沒有教、教我，怎麼認……那塊錶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"秒錶，時鐘……？我聽到，鐘聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"像往常一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，您的手……為什麼，冰涼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是火滾燙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我身上，也，發涼，而且，很痛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……但不是，因為……火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不懂……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，人們大多如此混沌地過活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到……死亡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，直到死亡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i08_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲哼唱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……奶奶，您唱的，究竟……是，什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"愛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我……痛苦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因為你正在愛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"愛，使人痛苦，使人忍耐，使人馴服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它同樣使人強大，使人富有，使人高貴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你正在愛，所以你痛苦；我愛你，所以分擔你的痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"別喬克不再說話。她用力閉眼，使身體更緊地蜷縮，卻不敢再觸碰像往常一樣撫摸著自己面頰的手。\n這些話她以前也聽過，那時她不需要在支離破碎的狀況中去尋找能夠支撐它們的論據，但現在，她不再確定。\n明明渾渾噩噩地活著，怎麼會比王公貴族更加富有和高貴呢？\n明明無能為力，又怎麼會比揮舞棍棒的權威更加強大呢？\n火堆近在眼前，它本應使人溫暖，別喬克卻感覺涼意已經侵入四肢百骸——\n經由那隻冰冷的、乾枯的手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我願意默想，並分擔你的痛苦。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“願我們所有人……”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“都能真心懺悔所犯的罪過。”"},{"type":"narration","text":"這個聲音只是重複，這個聲音只是回聲。\n這個回聲……指向毀滅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
